Mutation
- [N1] Node-level mutation: element=guard(b3,n3,"v1 = 'Yes'"); source=i2:If you "get a bonus",; reason=The guard replaces the source condition with an invented boolean assignment ('v1 = Yes'), distorting the original decision logic and failing to preserve the actual trigger.
- [N2] Node-level mutation: element=guard(b3,n4,"v1 = 'No'"); source=i4:If you "get a paycheck",; reason=The guard replaces the source condition with an invented boolean assignment ('v1 = No'), distorting the original decision logic and failing to preserve the actual trigger.
